import{_ as i,o as e,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 455 | Dragon Ball · Institutional-Alternative Benefits: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis Into Dragon Ball World","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 455 | Dragon Ball · Institutional-Alternative Benefits: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis Into Dragon Ball World","no":455,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Institutional Alternative","Anchor Symbiosis","Benefit Quantification","Quest Sediment Domain"],"related":["49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","22-Joint Contracting and Production-Resource Mechanism","23-20% Activation Strategy Plan"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0455_模块2-龙珠-制度替代收益-锚点共生注入龙珠世界.md","filePath":"en/0455_模块2-龙珠-制度替代收益-锚点共生注入龙珠世界.md"}'),a={name:"en/0455_模块2-龙珠-制度替代收益-锚点共生注入龙珠世界.md"};function r(s,t,l,c,d,u){return e(),n("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-455-dragon-ball-·-institutional-alternative-benefits-injecting-anchor-symbiosis-into-dragon-ball-world" tabindex="-1">Entry 455 | Dragon Ball · Institutional-Alternative Benefits: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis Into Dragon Ball World <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-455-dragon-ball-·-institutional-alternative-benefits-injecting-anchor-symbiosis-into-dragon-ball-world" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 455 | Dragon Ball · Institutional-Alternative Benefits: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis Into Dragon Ball World&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 24 · Alternative 4) | Benchmark base: Documents 49, 22, 23</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-install-an-institutional-engine-for-dragon-ball-world" tabindex="-1">Introduction: install an &quot;institutional engine&quot; for Dragon Ball world <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-install-an-institutional-engine-for-dragon-ball-world" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: install an &quot;institutional engine&quot; for Dragon Ball world&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous Quest Sediment Domain simulation (Entry 454) proved: Dragon Ball world collapses within 30 years under Goku absence. This entry gives the reverse simulation — if inject Anchor-Symbiosis institutions into Dragon Ball world, how much can the civilization index rise? This entry takes the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> as core, quantifying the benefit of &quot;institutions replacing personal combat power.&quot;</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-before-injection" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Before Injection) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-before-injection" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Before Injection)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before injection, Dragon Ball world&#39;s energy-waste index (Quest Sediment Domain quantification):</p><ul><li>Goku energy spillover rate (proportion directed to civilization): &lt;5%</li><li>Ki-theory publication rate: &lt;10%</li><li>Myriad-Ranks cultivator exit rate (highest combat power ordinary people can reach): &lt;1%</li><li>Civilization institutional maturity: &lt;1/10 (no rule of law, no parliament, no judiciary)</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-improvement-after-injection" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Improvement After Injection) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-improvement-after-injection" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Improvement After Injection)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After injecting Anchor-Symbiosis institutions, Quest Sediment Domain simulation observes improvements:</p><ol><li><strong>Stage 1 (10 years)</strong>: ki theory textbook-ified; Earth per-capita combat power rises 3×; Anchor Council established; Earth begins to have &quot;disaster review and defense act&quot;</li><li><strong>Stage 2 (50 years)</strong>: 20% activation strategy bears fruit; Earth appears a group of strong ones below Origin realm; Vegeta, Gohan no longer &quot;second strongest / third strongest,&quot; but one member of the strong-one group</li><li><strong>Stage 3 (100 years)</strong>: Dragon Ball wishing mechanism brought under Alaya supervision; revival goes Symbiotic Court approval; Earth civilization survival years rise from 30 to &gt;1000</li><li><strong>Conclusion</strong>: after injecting Anchor-Symbiosis institutions, Dragon Ball world&#39;s expected civilization survival rises 30× or more</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-transformation-after-injection" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Transformation After Injection) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-transformation-after-injection" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Transformation After Injection)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After injecting Anchor-Symbiosis institutions, Goku&#39;s predatory thinking transforms:</p><ul><li><strong>Enemies as EXP packs → enemies as trial objects</strong>: villains go reform/trial, not leveling fuel</li><li><strong>Training resources monopolized → training resources universal</strong>: Goku makes ki theory public; Vegeta no longer needs to &quot;chase Goku for decades&quot;</li><li><strong>Befriending dictators → negotiating with dictators</strong>: Goku represents Earth to negotiate with God of Destruction/Zeno, requiring &quot;any cosmos-tier operation goes through Myriad-Ranks parliament consent&quot;</li><li><strong>Combat instinct → guardianship duty</strong>: Goku&#39;s combat instinct redirected to &quot;guarding Myriad-Ranks co-build,&quot; not &quot;finding the next stronger opponent&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-benefit-comparison-table" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Benefit Comparison Table) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-benefit-comparison-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Benefit Comparison Table)&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Indicator</th><th>Before Injection</th><th>After Injection</th><th>Improvement Multiplier</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Goku energy spillover rate</td><td>&lt;5%</td><td>&gt;50%</td><td>10×</td></tr><tr><td>Ki-theory publication rate</td><td>&lt;10%</td><td>&gt;90%</td><td>9×</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Ranks cultivator exit rate</td><td>&lt;1%</td><td>&gt;30%</td><td>30×</td></tr><tr><td>Civilization institutional maturity</td><td>&lt;1/10</td><td>&gt;8/10</td><td>8×</td></tr><tr><td>Expected civilization survival</td><td>30 years</td><td>&gt;1000 years</td><td>30×</td></tr><tr><td>Combat-power inflation rate</td><td>Exponential</td><td>Linear</td><td>Controllable</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</td><td>High</td><td>Low</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball world; stage injection of Anchor-Symbiosis institutions</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: stage 1 ki theory public, stage 2 Anchor Council legislation, stage 3 Alaya supervision of wishing mechanism</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count the seven indicators&#39; stage-by-stage changes</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Anchor Symbiosis Injecting Dragon Ball World Benefit Report</em>, quantifying each institutional transformation step&#39;s civilization benefit</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Self-consistency before injection: 2/10</strong></li><li><strong>Expected self-consistency after injection: 9/10</strong></li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: from extremely high to low (law precedes, nine-realm legislation, appendix increment)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: from high (gift-style-leaning-oligarchic) to low (network)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Goku energy spillover rate from 5% to 50%</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: villains go trial, knowledge fully public, Myriad Ranks have roads</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo only built an academy; Anchor Symbiosis moved in the entire governance framework</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad-Ranks cultivator exit rate from 1% to 30%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: expected civilization survival from 30 years to 1000 years; can truly move toward multiverse expansion</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Institutions replacing personal combat power is not to eliminate Goku, but to turn Goku from &quot;the sole protector&quot; into &quot;one member of Myriad-Ranks co-build.&quot; Quest Sediment Domain simulation proves: injecting Anchor-Symbiosis institutions into Dragon Ball world, expected civilization survival rises 30× — this is not exaggeration, this is the inevitable benefit of changing &quot;bet on one person&quot; to &quot;bet on institutions.&quot; Letting institutions replace Goku is not a denial of Goku, but a liberation of Myriad Ranks.</p><p>One more layer of quantitative view: if Goku&#39;s energy were graded by Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;strength 40 / mind 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15&quot; four-dimensional exam, strength item he gets full marks, but contribution + responsibility totaling 35 points he is almost zero — he never legislated for civilization, never built institutions, never cultivated successors. This means Goku though &quot;strongest&quot; in Dragon Ball worldview, under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Plane-Transcendent Standards, his comprehensive score is only held up by the strength item; mind-cultivation item (never reflecting on predation) and contribution-responsibility item (zero institutional construction) seriously fail. The essence of institutional alternative is letting strong ones like Goku convert &quot;strength item&quot; into &quot;contribution-responsibility item.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · institutional-alternative benefits · injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Dragon Ball world described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./454_模块2-龙珠-求索域复盘-悟空缺位后的文明崩溃模拟.html">Entry 454 · Quest Sediment Domain Review</a> · <a href="./456_模块2-龙珠-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝战力膨胀的制度设计.html">Entry 456 · Alaya Supervision Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,m as default};
